        "Every child's journey is different",
        "We work with children and young people aged 2 to 18, alongside the adults who support them.",
        "Children & young people",
        "Including those with sensory processing differences, autism, ADHD, developmental coordination disorder (dyspraxia), and anxiety linked to sensory or motor challenges.",
        "Parents & carers",
        "We help families understand what's behind a behaviour or difficulty, and give clear, workable strategies for daily routines, mealtimes, sleep and outings.",
        "Schools & settings",
        "We collaborate with SENCOs and class teams on classroom-based strategies, EHCP contributions, and staff training, so support carries through the school day.",
        "Who we support"
      ]
